

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Subject above: imperative, ~50 chars. "Fix X", not "Fixed X" or "Fixes X".
# Blank line, then answer these three in prose. Delete these comments or
# leave them; lines starting with # are stripped automatically.
#
#   1. What was wrong?   The symptom, concretely. What would someone see?
#
#   2. Why did it happen? The cause, not the symptom.
#
#   3. What did you change, and why that choice rather than the obvious
#      alternative? This is the only part `git diff` cannot show, and the
#      only part that will still be useful in six months.
#
# If you cannot write paragraph 3, you do not understand the change well
# enough to keep it. That is the point of the rule, not a formality.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------
